WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:09.485
&gt;&gt;&gt; THREE GROUPS HAD THIS

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.852
LETTER THAT WAS ASKED TO BE

00:00:09.619 --> 00:00:11.887
ANONYMOUS.

00:00:09.986 --> 00:00:12.622
DIANNE FEINSTEIN AND HER

00:00:12.021 --> 00:00:13.356
STAFF.

00:00:12.755 --> 00:00:14.624
CONGRESSWOMAN FROM CALIFORNIA

00:00:13.489 --> 00:00:19.495
AND HER STAFF.

00:00:14.757 --> 00:00:22.365
AND THE LAWYERS.

00:00:19.629 --> 00:00:23.966
SOMEBODY BETRAYED HER TRUST.

00:00:22.498 --> 00:00:26.002
IF YOU CAN'T FIGURE OUT WHY,

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.736
YOU SHOULDN'T DRIVING.

00:00:26.202 --> 00:00:29.005
&gt;&gt; Tucker: CHRSTINE BLASEY

00:00:26.869 --> 00:00:29.372
FORD HAD WANTED TO REMAIN

00:00:29.138 --> 00:00:30.673
ANONYMOUS.

00:00:29.505 --> 00:00:31.574
SHE DIDN'T WANT TO TESTIFY

00:00:30.806 --> 00:00:33.275
YESTERDAY AND DIDN'T WANT

00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:34.910
ANYONE TO KNOW HER NAME.

00:00:33.409 --> 00:00:35.645
SHE ONLY WENT PUBLIC WITH THE

00:00:35.044 --> 00:00:36.712
ALLEGATIONS AFTER SOMEBODY

00:00:35.778 --> 00:00:38.047
LEAKED THEM TO THE PRESS.

00:00:36.846 --> 00:00:39.281
JUST A FEW WEEKS AGO.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.950
ONLY A FEW PEOPLE KNEW ABOUT

00:00:39.415 --> 00:00:43.119
THE LETTER THAT SHE HAD

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:44.520
WRITTEN TO CONGRESSMAN AND

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:45.488
THAT IT MADE ITS WAY TO

00:00:44.654 --> 00:00:45.821
SENATOR DIANNE FEINSTEIN'S

00:00:45.621 --> 00:00:47.523
OFFICE.

00:00:45.955 --> 00:00:49.625
FROM ONE OF THE OFFICES HER

00:00:47.657 --> 00:00:51.594
IDENTITY MADE IT TO REPORTERS.

00:00:49.759 --> 00:00:53.129
WHO DID THAT?

00:00:51.727 --> 00:00:54.997
AND WHY AREN'T DEMOCRATS

00:00:53.262 --> 00:00:56.599
INTERESTED IN FINDING OUT THE

00:00:55.131 --> 00:00:56.966
IDENTITY OF THE PERSON WHO DID

00:00:56.732 --> 00:00:58.834
THAT?

00:00:57.099 --> 00:01:01.737
SINCE SUPPOSEDLY THEY CARE SO

00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:05.207
DEEPLY ABOUT CHRISTINE FORD.

00:01:01.871 --> 00:01:07.810
McCARTHY WAS ANS SAYTANT

00:01:05.341 --> 00:01:08.477
U.S. ATTORNEY, AND JUDGE WAS A

00:01:07.943 --> 00:01:09.478
DISTRICT ATTORNEY IN

00:01:08.611 --> 00:01:11.147
WASHINGTON AND THEY JOIN US.

00:01:09.612 --> 00:01:12.348
WHY WOULDN'T BE SO HARD TO

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:13.582
FIND OUT HOW THE INFORMATION

00:01:12.481 --> 00:01:14.617
GOT FROM ONE OF TWO

00:01:13.716 --> 00:01:17.720
CONGRESSIONAL OFFICES TO THE

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:19.255
"WASHINGTON POST"?

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:20.756
&gt;&gt; TUCKER, IF WE ASSUME IT HAD

00:01:19.388 --> 00:01:22.925
TO BE ONE OF THE TWO OFFICES

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:24.126
THEN IT SHOULD BE A SMALL

00:01:23.059 --> 00:01:26.429
WORLD OF PEOPLE.

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:28.330
I THINK THE PROBLEM WE HAVE,

00:01:26.562 --> 00:01:31.534
FACTUALLY, IS THAT THE FIRST

00:01:28.464 --> 00:01:32.802
PRESS OUTLET WHO GOT IT, THE

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:33.703
INTERCEPT NOW SAYS THAT

00:01:32.935 --> 00:01:35.037
FEINSTEIN, SENATOR FEINSTEIN

00:01:33.836 --> 00:01:38.441
WAS NOT THE SOURCE.

00:01:35.171 --> 00:01:40.509
THAT DOESN'T MEAN THAT THE

00:01:38.574 --> 00:01:41.577
OTHER CALIFORNIA

00:01:40.643 --> 00:01:42.812
CONGRESSPERSON COULD NOT BE

00:01:41.711 --> 00:01:45.581
THE SOURCE OR IT COULD HAVE

00:01:42.945 --> 00:01:46.449
COME FROM THE LAWYERS OR WHAT

00:01:45.715 --> 00:01:47.950
HAPPENS AN ACQUAINTANCE OR

00:01:46.582 --> 00:01:50.419
FRIEND OF DR. FORD.

00:01:48.084 --> 00:01:53.022
BUT WHILE IT IS A SMALL AMOUNT

00:01:50.553 --> 00:01:55.224
OF PEOPLE WHO ARE IN THE

00:01:53.155 --> 00:01:57.460
CIRCLE OF THE POSSIBLE LEAKER,

00:01:55.358 --> 00:01:58.261
AND IF YOU MADE AN AGGRESSIVE

00:01:57.593 --> 00:02:00.096
INVESTIGATION YOU MIGHT BE

00:01:58.394 --> 00:02:01.030
ABLE TO GET SOME LEADS

00:02:00.229 --> 00:02:03.533
QUICKLY.

00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:04.667
CERTAINLY, IF KAVANAUGH CAN BE

00:02:03.666 --> 00:02:06.402
INVESTIGATED SEVEN TIMES YOU

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:06.836
THINK IT MIGHT BE WORTH A ONCE

00:02:06.536 --> 00:02:09.205
OVER.

00:02:07.036 --> 00:02:09.739
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU WOULD THINK

00:02:09.338 --> 00:02:10.606
THAT.

00:02:09.939 --> 00:02:12.208
&gt;&gt; IT'S INTERESTING.

00:02:10.807 --> 00:02:13.810
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IF YOU CARED

00:02:12.341 --> 00:02:16.245
ABOUT CHRISTINE FORD WOULDN'T

00:02:13.943 --> 00:02:17.313
YOU CARE WHO BETRAYED HER AND

00:02:16.379 --> 00:02:18.114
OVERTURNED HER LIFE?

00:02:17.513 --> 00:02:19.215
