00:02:18.247 --> 00:02:20.283
BUT THIS IS NOT WHAT IT IS

00:02:19.348 --> 00:02:22.485
ABOUT FOR THE DEMOCRATS.

00:02:20.416 --> 00:02:23.152
THIS IS NOT ABOUT THE ETHICS

00:02:22.618 --> 00:02:24.320
OR MORALITY OR RIGHTNESS.

00:02:23.286 --> 00:02:26.222
THIS IS ABOUT POWER.

00:02:24.454 --> 00:02:27.924
THE DEMOCRATS LEAKED IT, THE

00:02:26.355 --> 00:02:29.292
LAWYERS LEAKED IT, MAYBE SHE

00:02:28.057 --> 00:02:31.928
LEAKED IT OR SOMEONE IN HER

00:02:29.425 --> 00:02:34.363
FAMILY LEAKED.

00:02:32.061 --> 00:02:35.264
WE KNOW THE REPUBLICANS DIDN'T

00:02:34.497 --> 00:02:36.332
LEAK IT BECAUSE THEY DIDN'T

00:02:35.398 --> 00:02:38.468
HAVE THE LETTER.

00:02:36.466 --> 00:02:40.470
SOMEONE WANTED TO USE HER AND

00:02:38.601 --> 00:02:41.270
MAKE PARROT OF A PROCESS TO

00:02:40.603 --> 00:02:43.906
FLAY AWAY AT JUDGE KAVANAUGH.

00:02:41.404 --> 00:02:45.108
THIS IS PART OF THE DISGUSTING

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.441
DISPLAY THAT THE DEMOCRATS

00:02:45.241 --> 00:02:46.676
CREATED.

00:02:45.575 --> 00:02:47.710
THEY ARE TRYING TO MAKE IT

00:02:46.809 --> 00:02:48.044
LOOK LIKE SOMETHING THAT IS

00:02:47.844 --> 00:02:50.113
SERIOUS.

00:02:48.177 --> 00:02:51.814
IN FACT, IT'S AWFUL.

00:02:50.246 --> 00:02:52.648
IT IS DEMEANING THE COUNTRY

00:02:51.948 --> 00:02:54.617
AND DEMEANING THE SENATE.

00:02:52.782 --> 00:02:56.085
I DON'T KNOW WHAT AFFECT IT IS

00:02:54.751 --> 00:02:57.020
HAVING ON DR. FORD OR WHATEVER

00:02:56.219 --> 00:02:58.655
HER NAME IS.

00:02:57.153 --> 00:03:00.190
THE BOTTOM LINE IS THAT THIS

00:02:58.788 --> 00:03:01.524
IS AN ATTEMPT TO DESTROY A

00:03:00.323 --> 00:03:03.193
GOOD MAN AND HIS FAMILY.

00:03:01.658 --> 00:03:03.660
AND THE DEMOCRATS ARE

00:03:03.326 --> 00:03:05.361
SUCCEEDING.

00:03:03.793 --> 00:03:06.763
THEY GOT THEIR DELAY ON THE

00:03:05.495 --> 00:03:15.939
VOTE ON THE STATE FLOOR.

00:03:06.896 --> 00:03:17.273
THEY MAY ULTIMATELY WIN.

00:03:16.139 --> 00:03:18.274
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU HAVE BEEN

00:03:17.407 --> 00:03:19.709
