00:03:25.315 --> 00:03:28.218
&gt;&gt; THAT IT IS PHENOMENAL THAT

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:29.552
THE DEMOCRATS COULD NOT MORE

00:03:28.351 --> 00:03:31.221
CLEARLY SIGNAL THAT WHAT THIS

00:03:29.686 --> 00:03:31.955
IS ALL ABOUT IS THE DELAY,

00:03:31.354 --> 00:03:33.056
DELAY, DELAY.

00:03:32.088 --> 00:03:33.523
NO MATTER WHAT THEY ARE

00:03:33.189 --> 00:03:34.824
